(There are also routines that let you find solutions to equations. For ex\ample, if )Tj
0 -1.2 TD
(Ax=b and you want to find x, a slow way to find x is to simply invert A \and )Tj
T*
(perform a left multiply on both sides \(more on that later\). It turns o\ut that there are )Tj
T*
(more efficient and more stable methods to do this \(L/U decomposition wi\th )Tj
T*
(pivoting, for example\). Matlab has special commands that will do this f\or you. )Tj
