(that if A and B are both matrices, then AB is not necessarily equal to B\A. To )Tj
0 -1.2 TD
(distinguish the difference between solving systems that have a right or \left )Tj
T*
(multiply, Matlab uses two different operators, "/" and "\\". Examples of\ their use )Tj
T*
(are given below. It is left as an exercise for you to figure out which o\ne is doing )Tj
T*
(what. )Tj
